Port 22
AddressFamily inet
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0

PermitRootLogin no
AllowUsers player
PasswordAuthentication yes
PermitEmptyPasswords no
PubkeyAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
UsePAM yes

DisableForwarding yes
PermitTunnel no
X11Forwarding no
PermitUserEnvironment no

LoginGraceTime 30
MaxAuthTries 3
MaxSessions 2
PrintMotd no
PrintLastLog yes
LogLevel VERBOSE

Subsystem sftp internal-sftp
